// An array as a value, chart instances and references: ref bind el. KIELER rejects it: assignment to ‘int’ from ‘int
// *’ makes integer from pointer without a cast [-Wint-conversion].
scchart Main { int m[2][2] = {{4,7},{8,1}} int c[2] output int x initial state A is Sub(m[1], c, x) } scchart Sub { input int p[2] input int q[2] output int o initial state A do o = p[0] + (q - p) go to A }
